.TH "mtx-chars" "1" "01-01-2026" "version 0.10" "MkII Character Table Generators"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
 mtx-chars \- MkII Character Table Generators
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B mtxrun --script chars [
.I OPTIONS ...
.B ] [
.I FILENAMES
.B ]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.B MkII Character Table Generators
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
.B --xtx
generate xetx-*.tex (used by xetex)
.TP
.B --pdf
generate pdfr-def.tex (used by pdftex)
.TP
.B --entities
generate entities table
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
More information about ConTeXt and the tools that come with it can be found at:


